Source: hyphenation/tex-hyphen, commit 5684c0f51c0b81133db2efbe60a408b4155a3ff5
hyph-utf8/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/tex/hyph-en-us.tex
The accompanying .pat.txt and .hyp.txt inputs are unchanged. patterns.js is a
mechanical numeric representation generated by tools/compile-hyphens.mjs.
These data include the original Plain TeX patterns and the additional patterns
and exceptions described in the upstream file. No hyphenation implementation
from that repository or Justice is included.
